    { "", "Corrected lore in 11 entries.", "" },
    { "Willo's keys can be combinations", "Ctrl, Alt or Shift with a key, like Ctrl+T, for talking to her or to the one you're targeting. A key the game already uses can be hers while Lore Forever is on, and still does its old job without it.", "Willo's keys can be combinations:" },
    { "", "Narration now always matches the words on screen: with Lore Forever in another language, a story your narrator hasn't recorded shows as text instead of playing in English.", "" },
    { "Willo's chats are one ongoing talk", "no chats to start or pick. Her window shows everything you've asked, by day and by character, with older days folded to what you did in the game; click a character to see only theirs.", "Willo's chats are one ongoing talk:" },
    { "Forget anything you said, or clear the screen", "every line has a ⋯ (or right-click it) with Forget this, and each day has Forget this day, with Undo; Willo stops using it. \"New chat\" now clears the screen instead, and Willo still remembers what came before.", "Forget anything you said, or clear the screen:" },
