    { "Stories in dungeons are read aloud again", "after a fight where the rest of your group fought on longer than you, narration no longer stays silent for minutes, inside the dungeon or after you leave.", "Stories in dungeons are read aloud again:" },
    { "", "Options fit in German, Portuguese, French and Spanish: long key names wrap instead of being cut off, and the Move things on screen buttons no longer run past their edge or off the page.", "" },
    { "", "Asking \"what's here\" now tells you about the place you're standing in, not a nearby place's side story.", "" },
    { "", "When your microphone is muted or blocked, Willo now says so and where to fix it, instead of asking you to hold the key while you speak.", "" },
