    { "", "Willo: \"Check your microphone\" is the first row of her Settings. Hold one button, say anything, and she tells you in one line what's wrong and how to fix it: your microphone, a faint voice, your talk key, or trouble on her side. Her \"I can't hear you\" lines now have a \"Check my microphone\" button.", "" },
    { "Willo waits for Lore Forever's update", "asked to restart for her own update while Lore Forever is still updating in your game, she no longer cuts it off half-way; she says her update can start as soon as that's done.", "Willo waits for Lore Forever's update:" },
    { "Willo's voice follows your PC's sound", "with no speakers picked for her, she plays where Windows plays her right now (a headset you switch to, or the output you set for her in Windows), and stays there after an update.", "Willo's voice follows your PC's sound:" },
